    </div>
    <div class="rsb-faq">
      <FaqItem question="What is the minimum order quantity (MOQ) for noise barriers?" answer="Our standard MOQ is 500 meters of noise barrier panels. For custom projects, we can discuss flexible MOQ based on your specific requirements. We understand that smaller projects may need special arrangements, so please contact our sales team to discuss your needs." />
      <FaqItem question="What is the lead time for noise barrier orders?" answer="Standard items: 20 working days. Custom orders: 40 working days. Rush orders can be arranged with a premium. Lead time includes production, quality inspection and documentation preparation. Shipping time is additional and depends on your destination port." />
      <FaqItem question="Do you offer OEM/ODM services?" answer="Yes, we provide full OEM/ODM services including custom designs, colors, dimensions, and branding. We can manufacture noise barriers to your exact specifications and can include your company logo or branding on the panels and packaging." />
      <FaqItem question="What certifications do your products have?" answer="All products are CE certified per EN 1793/EN 1794, ISO 9001/14001/45001 certified, and meet GB/T 51335-2018 standards. We provide third-party test reports with every shipment including acoustic performance data." />
      <FaqItem question="What is the warranty period for noise barriers?" answer="We offer a 15-year structural warranty and 25-year design lifespan for our noise barrier products. The warranty covers manufacturing defects and material failures. Proper installation and maintenance are required to maintain warranty coverage." />
      <FaqItem question="Do you provide installation services?" answer="Yes, we provide turnkey installation services worldwide, or ship CKD (completely knocked down) for self-installation. Our experienced installation teams have completed projects in over 60 countries. We also provide detailed installation manuals and on-site supervision if required." />
      <FaqItem question="How do I request a sample?" answer="Sample requests are welcome. We can provide small panel samples (typically 300mm x 300mm) for evaluation. Please contact our sales team with your address and we'll arrange shipment. Sample costs and shipping fees apply." />
      <FaqItem question="What payment terms do you offer?" answer="We accept T/T (Telegraphic Transfer), L/C (Letter of Credit), and PayPal for smaller orders. Our standard payment terms are 30% deposit upon order confirmation, 70% balance before shipment. Flexible terms may be available for long-term partners." />
      <FaqItem question="What shipping options are available?" answer="We ship worldwide via sea freight (FCL/LCL), air freight, or express courier. FOB Shenzhen or EXW factory pricing is available. We handle all export documentation including commercial invoices, packing lists, certificates of origin, and CE certificates." />
      <FaqItem question="Can you provide acoustic simulation and engineering support?" answer="Yes, our engineering team provides acoustic simulation using state-of-the-art software to predict insertion loss for your specific project. We also provide CAD drawings, structural calculations and BIM models upon request." />
